# I2P (i2pd) configuration

i2pd is a lightweight C++ I2P router. Replaces Java I2P.

## Ports
- 7070 - Web Console (http://i2p:7070)
- 4444 - HTTP proxy (outbound)
- 4447 - SOCKS proxy (outbound)
- 7656 - SAM bridge (app access)
- 45678 - NTCP2/SSU2 transport (external, configurable)

## Eepsite management
Eepsite tunnels are defined in tunnels.conf.
Use the CLI:
  homelab i2p enable <service>   # add eepsite tunnel
  homelab i2p disable <service>  # remove eepsite tunnel
  homelab i2p list               # list active tunnels

After changes, i2pd reloads config automatically via SIGHUP.
